'''Zorua''' (Japanese: '''ゾロア''' ''Zorua'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

