==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration from the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion was first featured on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Zorua|12}}, one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Zorua|90}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

